abstract: >-
  Companion repository for the PeerJ Computer Science survey "Fine-Tuning Large
  Language Models in Resource-Constrained Environments: Methods and Trade-offs"
  (under review). Documents the structured literature search, screening
  decisions, and reproducibility artifacts. Extraction and table population
  (Phases 4–5) are not yet complete.
keywords:
  - large language models
  - parameter-efficient fine-tuning
  - quantization
  - federated learning
  - survey
